29ed9acd445"))(text "230 VAC / 50 Hz | 207-253 V screen | total ~135 mA, LED ~133 mA / 60 V / ~8 W LED | 4000 K, CRI >=80"(at 15 24 0)(effects(font(size 1.3 1.3))(justify left))(uuid "d0a28e3e-740c-5d1c-88de-a7df971aa1b4"))(text "1. Fused input / MOV / bridge / RC input filter"(at 15 35 0)(effects(font(size 1.5 1.5))(justify left))(uuid "47cd5302-f2ef-542e-a76f-d050717d322c"))(text "2. High-side buck / current sense / base reservoir"(at 206 35 0)(effects(font(size 1.5 1.5))(justify left))(uuid "cd58a027-5f53-5921-ad3a-0ca878132dcc"))(text "3. Output-voltage monitor / BP supply"(at 116 136 0)(effects(font(size 1.5 1.5))(justify left))(uuid "16470130-fda6-5eb8-9fff-28f110ad3ba7"))(text "T1: catalogue Wurth 7687709152, 1.5mH / 400V, two SMD terminals. SC09 SB01 procurement candidate; NOT an isolation transformer."(at 15 200 0)(effects(font(size 1.2 1.2))(justify left))(uuid "dfc753bf-d731-596b-866d-9aebf8cde0a0"))(text "R5 || R6 = 0.57321 ohm. Estimated total = 135.2 mA; LED ~133.4 mA at 60 V after bleeders; actual corners unmeasured."(at 15 208 0)(effects(font(size 1.2 1.2))(justify left))(uuid "eb35f558-adea-54c3-a0cc-34b36f559fb2"))(text "C6 100 V. Static OVP nominal 77.9 V; dynamic COUT target <=90 V remains unverified. Dual 68k bleeders: one-open screen 36.45 s, 90 to 5 V."(at 15 216 0)(effects(font(size 1.2 1.2))(justify left))(uuid "2eaff15d-7b54-5040-b94c-d7c3d3fa3808"))(text "All nets and LED terminals are MAINS REFERENCED, NOT SELV. Replace LED module only deenergized with verified discharge. No powered hot-plug."(at 15 228 0)(effects(font(size 1.3 1.3))(justify left))(uuid "6b74c26c-b459-5278-a103-ee23c174f2d8"))(text "LAB PROTOTYPE: owner authorized continued schematic/PCB design. Insulation, manufacturing release and powered tests remain unqualified."(at 15 237 0)(effects(font(size 1.3 1.3))(justify left))(uuid "0f81a48e-b931-5cd9-85fa-6cad2d925f8f"))(text "Before acceptance: environment/lifetime/optical assumptions, insulation/test basis, endpoint envelopes, current/OVP/fault corner review."(at 15 246 0)(effects(font(size 1.2 1.2))(justify left))(uuid "323aa8f0-19b4-5b46-949f-f9f7527dbf9d"))(text "SB01-R2: L1 legacy position = PR02FS 100R RC damper, NOT a choke. Manual lead forming <=16mm; EMI/hot/fault qualification open."(at 15 255 0)(effects(font(size 1.2 1.2))(justify left))(uuid "8096e65e-2adb-5860-b82f-d3383c228ec4")))